      "content": "it's not that simple. you don't get it. you can't \"fix\" the fact that i'm fundamentally broken. people are going to suffer because of me, and as long as i'm around, that shadow just follows everything. it feels less like a mistake i made and more like who i am now. how can you talk about \"change\" when the core of me is just... ruined?",
